        = s.current.p
      /\ log_ext s.current.g s.final.g /\ s.final.g.wq = s.current.g.wq)
    /\ ([@stop_split] [@expl:batch_lookup ensures #1] [%#sbatch'1] Seq.length (view_Vec_Outcome_Global result'0.f0)
